{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":28,"ref":"1-kings 20:28","book":"1-kings","lang":"so","chapter":20,"translation":"Wuxuu soo dhowaaday nin Elohim (ahna nin Elohim), wuxuuna ku yidhi boqorka Israa'iil, wuxuuna yidhi: Sidaas ayuu Yahweh yidhiahay, sababtoo ah Aram (reer Suuriya) bay yidhaahdeen: Yahweh waa Elohim buuraha, oo ma aha Elohim godobada; anigoo aan ahay mid ka fiican (waa ana), waan idinku siinayaa ⟨את⟩ ciidanka weyn oo dhan gacantaada, waadna ogaan doontaan inaan ana ahay Yahweh.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויגש","gloss":"Wuxuu soo dhowaaday"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"nin"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"Elohim (Elohim)"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"wuxuuna ku yidhi"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"ku"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"boqorka"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Israa'iil"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"wuxuuna yidhi"},{"surface":"כה","gloss":"Sidaas"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"ayuu yidhi"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"יען","gloss":"sababtoo ah"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"(in)"},{"surface":"אמרו","gloss":"bay yidhaahdeen"},{"surface":"ארם","gloss":"Aram (reer Suuriya)"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"הרים","gloss":"buuraha"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"oo ma aha"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"עמקים","gloss":"godobada"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"waa ana"},{"surface":"ונתתי","gloss":"waan idinku siinayaa"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"ciidanka weyn oo dhan"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"oo dhan"},{"surface":"ההמון","gloss":"ciidanka"},{"surface":"הגדול","gloss":"weyn"},{"surface":"הזה","gloss":"kan"},{"surface":"בידך","gloss":"gacantaada"},{"surface":"וידעתם","gloss":"waadna ogaan doontaan"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"in"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"ana"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-01T08:51:36.096071993Z","model":"glm-5.3"}